{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by my love for densely built cities around the world\u2014the kind of places where every wall, alley, and rooftop tells a story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be encouraged to build upwards, fill the smallest gaps, and find clever ways to place light sources or decorations to bring your creations to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like when you\u2019re packing a bag, there\u2019s always room for one more thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/b435b19b1f6249d64133ca68247e2dee.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll step into the role of a surveyor, tasked with building and photographing 20 distinct locations. Each site offers its own set of objects and atmosphere, but how everything comes together is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are possible for large structures like buildings and gates, but to complete it, you must provide them with light, utility, and decorations. Upon completion, you will be awarded new unlockable objects and decorations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are finished with a location, take a photo of it to add to your dossier and prepare to move on to your next blank canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/3f05fa23056b478de1cb918440990700.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location comes with its own twists and sights. You might be working with food trucks, neon signs, or smokestacks. The challenge isn\u2019t in following rules, but in making something that feels alive within ShantyTown.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual game through and through. <i>There are no wrong answers here.</i> Remember to make each placement personal, and every messy little corner adds to the charm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/b59d4b0db57811b7f28c969a3963e0ec.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique decorations across every map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each location\u2019s story as you build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional goals to guide your creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful, atmospheric scenery to unwind with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth camera settings to frame your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden objects waiting to be found</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time or pressure.</strong> Please, enjoy everything at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434600?t=1764249680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/17346db63c6382981dabcf097ed0aa4d6a35df6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764249680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/45bfd7162447bc82e4b6fea14fcb8105dbdd3ee9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764249680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/45bfd7162447bc82e4b6fea14fcb8105dbdd3ee9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764249680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3701340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/212fa33b331b3391255b6938f27bba72.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by my love for densely built cities around the world\u2014the kind of places where every wall, alley, and rooftop tells a story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be encouraged to build upwards, fill the smallest gaps, and find clever ways to place light sources or decorations to bring your creations to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like when you\u2019re packing a bag, there\u2019s always room for one more thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/b435b19b1f6249d64133ca68247e2dee.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/30acb48174170d1574c6cdaf3bdff19e.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll step into the role of a surveyor, tasked with building and photographing 20 distinct locations. Each site offers its own set of objects and atmosphere, but how everything comes together is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are possible for large structures like buildings and gates, but to complete it, you must provide them with light, utility, and decorations. Upon completion, you will be awarded new unlockable objects and decorations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are finished with a location, take a photo of it to add to your dossier and prepare to move on to your next blank canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/3f05fa23056b478de1cb918440990700.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/de257ad4e43b17423aaf234d52680e61.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location comes with its own twists and sights. You might be working with food trucks, neon signs, or smokestacks. The challenge isn\u2019t in following rules, but in making something that feels alive within ShantyTown.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual game through and through. <i>There are no wrong answers here.</i> Remember to make each placement personal, and every messy little corner adds to the charm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/b59d4b0db57811b7f28c969a3963e0ec.webp?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.poster.avif?t=1764249680\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.webm?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/extras/a2c02b99471aee5339df19f2bde1bd83.mp4?t=1764249680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique decorations across every map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each location\u2019s story as you build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional goals to guide your creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful, atmospheric scenery to unwind with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth camera settings to frame your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden objects waiting to be found</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time or pressure.</strong> Please, enjoy everything at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Erik Rempen"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/9c5821255a378fc361e2258122cf741c0b10b681/header.jpg?t=1764249680","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749224788","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749224788","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/272157977/d1f528dc23fb1729ed629c2a3defb218a0f077db/1750918690/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749224788","id":257152206,"name":"Demo Launch","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152206/d2b97ffd02ff1cf960134b6f1656ceb76e0eab22/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749224788"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/859373/d38159de284c067d1f77112a3f29962d91023bb4/1750918686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749225016","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/859373/d38159de284c067d1f77112a3f29962d91023bb4/1750918686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749225016","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434600/859373/d38159de284c067d1f77112a3f29962d91023bb4/1750918686/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749225016","id":257119498,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119498/b0bfdbc13da5eeadc2a361e18df0c68d41cdb1f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749225016"}],"name":"ShantyTown","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU, Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM, OpenGL 3.0 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Have Fun!</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kinephantom Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/2bb2421c2877c815009b3dee931b0dfee809f164/ss_2bb2421c2877c815009b3dee931b0dfee809f164.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764249680","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/2bb2421c2877c815009b3dee931b0dfee809f164/ss_2bb2421c2877c815009b3dee931b0dfee809f164.600x338.jpg?t=1764249680"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434600/2c84f0ba3abeb854f0a3b0b62fd48d33969f6691/ss_2c84f0ba3abeb854f0a3b0b62fd48d33969f6691.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764249680","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/24346